"schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:57b17f68b75bc27f87ff5f0931fd8f677aee8af5632f5cf4e52c590dbc2f0b5f","file":"preprints/Independent-products-in-real-L1-asymptotic-midpoint-convexity-without-AUC-renormings-September-27-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":57,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"b1f8a23758e35234ae3668611ee169b5291510228da7eddb31641490d33f2911","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Independent-products-in-real-L1-asymptotic-midpoint-convexity-without-AUC-renormings-September-27-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:57b17f68b75bc27f87ff5f0931fd8f677aee8af5632f5cf4e52c590dbc2f0b5f","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Independent-products-in-real-L1-asymptotic-midpoint-convexity-without-AUC-renormings-September-27-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L57"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nFor every multiplier $W$ as above, the Banach space $X_W$ is infinite\ndimensional and has no equivalent AUC norm.\nFor the exponential and Gaussian-square laws, the inherited norms satisfy\n\\begin{align}\n \\whdelta_{X_{\\mathrm{exp}}}(t)\n &\\ge \\frac{7t}{30}c(10/t)>0 &&(t>0),\\label{eq:main-exp}\\\\\n \\whdelta_{X_{\\mathrm{sq}}}(t)\n &\\ge\\frac{\\PP\\bigl(|G|\\ge4\\sqrt2(2+\\sqrt2)/t\\bigr)}{8}>0\n &&(t>0),\\label{eq:main-sq24}\\\\\n \\whdelta_{X_{\\mathrm{sq}}}(t)\n &\\ge\\frac{\\PP\\bigl(|G|\\ge8\\sqrt6/t\\bigr)}{4}>0\n &&(t>0).\\label{eq:main-sq12}\n\\end{align}"}
